WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.442 --> 00:00:03.509
Unit twenty-three. Oral Health for Teens!

2
00:00:04.406 --> 00:00:08.023
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.073 --> 00:00:10.998
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:14.693
Today we learn about Oral Health for Teens. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.772 --> 00:00:18.239
Teeth. Say it with me. Teeth!

6
00:00:21.791 --> 00:00:24.925
Gums. Say it with me. Gums!

7
00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:32.030
Braces. Say it with me. Braces!

8
00:00:35.487 --> 00:00:38.837
Floss. Say it with me. Floss!

9
00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:45.673
Sugar. Say it with me. Sugar!

10
00:00:49.121 --> 00:00:52.721
Smoking. Say it with me. Smoking!

11
00:00:56.242 --> 00:00:59.475
Dentist. Say it with me. Dentist!

12
00:01:02.953 --> 00:01:06.337
Fluoride. Say it with me. Fluoride!

13
00:01:09.842 --> 00:01:19.614
Teens need to brush with fluoride toothpaste and floss daily, especially with braces. Sugar and smoking harm teeth and gums. Regular dentist visits prevent problems.

14
00:01:19.664 --> 00:01:22.613
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:24.019 --> 00:01:29.062
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.112 --> 00:01:30.263
Braces!

17
00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:36.219
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.269 --> 00:01:37.367
Dentist!

19
00:01:38.086 --> 00:01:44.849
Did you know? Bleeding gums can be a sign of gum disease, which brushing and flossing can help prevent!

20
00:01:44.899 --> 00:01:46.700
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.423 --> 00:01:54.889
Think and answer. Why is flossing important with braces?

22
00:01:54.939 --> 00:01:56.089
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.392 --> 00:02:01.816
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.866 --> 00:02:04.376
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

